        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So, Rabit's power is basically a built-in portal gun (look up the Portal games by Valve if you don't know what that is). Cool :D.<span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p><span>Yep!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> </span></p>\n<p><span>(In the Imprisoned Rogue card art, you can see the portal he's stepping through behind him.)</span></p>",
